  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 806.01 Required Health Effects Language for Regulated Inorganic Chemical (IOC) Contaminants",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 806.01 Required Health Effects Language for Regulated Inorganic Chemical (IOC) Contaminants. The O/O shall use the statements specified in this part, as applicable, as the statement required by Env-Dw 801.03(a)(3) to describe the adverse health effects for the IOC contaminants specified in Env-Dw 704.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 800) #9730, eff 6-30-10; ss by #12675, eff 1-1-19",
